{
  "build": "2026-10-25-one-platform",
  "seq": 34,
  "ref": "206f8718224592ad9a81f55a4cdd68af0c5e0736",
  "title": "learnwithmrcedric: one platform",
  "notes": [
    "Students: one app. Now shows the one thing to do, My file is the binder (red means I owe it, green means it is in), Me holds the avatar, points, shop, night market, arcade and badges. Handing in takes two taps and the tab turns green at once. The answer key opens after corrections are handed in",
    "Teacher Hub: Today, Chapters and Students, with Settings in the menu. Teach is one click, Check and return then Return is two. Needs you is the one list of things to do. While you teach, names turn into initials on the laptop",
    "Your phone (open /exec?phone, paired with a 4-digit code from the Hub): Back and Next, quick checks (A B C D, True or false, Got it / Nearly / Lost, a word, or the question on the slide), Eyes on me, Together or Own pace, Who is stuck, Let in, and End with 4 seconds to undo",
    "The slides (bridge 15): quick checks appear at the bottom of the slide, students sign in from learnwithmrcedric with no typing, work done just before Teach is kept, and the projector never shows a name. The Streak top 5 shows initials",
    "Lesson 5 (1.5 Which instrument fits the job?) is its own lesson now, with its own place in Chapter 1",
    "One sheet: Settings, One sheet, Make the one sheet copies every tab of both old sheets into a new private sheet and checks each tab. Switch to the one sheet runs at a quiet time. The two old sheets are never changed, and Go back to the old sheets works until the end of the next school day",
    "Faster: the iPads ask less often and never while hidden, a whole class opening the app at once reads the sheet once, and answers no longer wait for each other",
    "Safer: only you (the owner) can make, switch or go back from the one sheet, going back copies new hand-ins, answers and points back into the old sheets, End always finishes even if the laptop is closed straight after, and Sign out signs a student out on every device",
    "Fallback: the New version switch in Settings (off, test, on), or add ?classic to any link for the release 33 pages"
  ],
